# the literal (unmatchable) gitignore pattern, so scec_archive/ was NOT
# ignored despite every doc in this repo saying it is. 693 files / ~1.16 GB
# were tracked by f2c9851 as a result. Untracked going forward in the same
# commit that fixed this pattern; the blobs remain in git history until a
# deliberate, owner-approved history rewrite (out of scope for a release).
